Z||000004||roadwarrior||10-06-2001||09:32 PM||||sure fiero's may have problem but like back on holiday's said all cars have problems, just means that you gotta be more vigorous with the maintenance, I get mine up on the ramps at least once a week to check the grease bouts, frame junctions and so forth, but it assures a trouble free relation with my car, by catching problems before the occur and leave me stranded.||||reg||1
